    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it seems like the \"opponents\" side was mostly just people being difficult or spreading fake news though. like, if the science was there, why was it even a \"debate\" instead of just a settled fact? was there actually any legitimate reasoning behind the anti-mandate stuff or was it just people ignoring the science?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
